    "notes": "MIXED VINTAGE — say so wherever this is cited. The domestic instrument rows (Treasury Bonds, Treasury Bills, CBK Overdraft, Advances from Commercial Banks) were re-sourced from the CBK Statistical Bulletin of December 2025, Tables 4.1.3 and 4.1.4, by the 2026-08-29 correction. The external rows (multilateral, bilateral, commercial) still carry the April 2025 baseline and have NOT been re-sourced. The rows are aggregate categories, not individual instruments, so this register is coarser than Kenya's actual portfolio. Its sum is not a figure any publisher states: CBK's own aggregate for December 2025 is KES 12.299T against this register's ~13.55T, and the two are unreconciled. Do not label this register with a single bulletin issue date."
